              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ekigambo kya MUKAMA kikaija ahari Ezekieli omunyamurwa, mwene Buuzi, ari omu nsi y'Abakaludaaya aha mugyera Kebari; ikwo niyo omukono gwa MUKAMA gwamuhikiireho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
