            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ku naagiire kugira nti, naareeba omuyaga gw'amaani gwaija niguruga aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho, n'ekicu kuhango ekyehinguririziibwe omushana ogurikumurinkana, kyaguma nikirugwamu omuriro ogurikurabya nk'omurabyo, kandi ahagati y'ogwo muriro haabaho ekintu ekirikushusha nk'omuringa ogurikwengyengyeta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
