            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ahansi yaakyo amapapa gaabyo gashashaanwire, buri rimwe nirireebana na rigyanzi ryaryo; kandi buri kuhangirwe kiine amapapa abiri gashwekire omubiri gwakyo. ",
          "type": "text",
