        {
          "text": " Kandi ku byabaire bigyenda, mpurira okuhoorera kw'amapapa gaabyo kuri nk'okuhoorera kw'amaizi maingi, nk'okuhinda kw'Ow'obushoboorozi bwona, obwaku bwakwo buri nk'obw'orwari rw'eihe ry'engabo; ku byabaire byemerera, bigwisa amapapa gaabyo. ",
          "type": "text",
